{"id":"b271bf5e7002b205","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness.md","title":"Soundness of Closed GL Tableaux","display":"lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness — Soundness of Closed GL Tableaux","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness","aliases":["89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness"],"display":"lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness — Soundness of Closed GL Tableaux","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]]","[[89-lem-gl-tableau-window]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness — Soundness of Closed GL Tableaux"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59e94f1adddc4fdd\" href=\"?note=59e94f1adddc4fdd\" title=\"89-df-gl-tableau-procedure\">89-df-gl-tableau-procedure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ffd0dbc00149f28a\" href=\"?note=ffd0dbc00149f28a\" title=\"89-lem-gl-tableau-window\">89-lem-gl-tableau-window</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(T,U\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_A^0\\Rightarrow^*T\">\\(T_A^0\\Rightarrow^*T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow^*\">\\(\\Rightarrow^*\\)</span> 为有限次重写的自反传递闭包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cl}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cl}\\)</span> 取真值树特征公式与闭合定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}closed\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT\\Rightarrow U&amp;\\Longrightarrow(\\chi(T)\\leftrightarrow\\chi(U))\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}(T)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\chi(T)\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\nT_A^0\\Rightarrow^*T\\land\\mathsf{Cl}(T)&amp;\\Longrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}closed\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT\\Rightarrow U&amp;\\Longrightarrow(\\chi(T)\\leftrightarrow\\chi(U))\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}(T)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\chi(T)\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\nT_A^0\\Rightarrow^*T\\land\\mathsf{Cl}(T)&amp;\\Longrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 10 章 pp.143–144。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>正合取、负合取和双重否定规则由命题等价保持局部特征公式。窗口规则由窗口见证引理保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(b)\">\\(\\chi(b)\\)</span>：旧分支条件蕴含新窗口的可能式，旧条件继续保留。若改写发生在嵌套窗口内，正规性把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\leftrightarrow G\">\\(F\\leftrightarrow G\\)</span> 提升为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond F\\leftrightarrow\\Diamond G\">\\(\\Diamond F\\leftrightarrow\\Diamond G\\)</span>，再在上层布尔语境中替换。</p>\n<p>对度数归纳：出现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 或互否公式的分支特征式可被 GL 否定；若分支含闭窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>，归纳假设给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\chi(U)\">\\(\\neg\\chi(U)\\)</span>，必然化给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Diamond\\chi(U)\">\\(\\neg\\Diamond\\chi(U)\\)</span>，故否定该分支。全体分支闭合后否定它们的有限析取。</p>\n<p>初始特征式与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span> 命题等价，有限重写保持等价，闭合遂推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。此证明只用 GL 的规则及窗口引理，不使用 GL 完全性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-tableau-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"59e94f1adddc4fdd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-tableau-window","status":"resolved","id":"ffd0dbc00149f28a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-tableau-window]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,U\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"T_A^0\\Rightarrow^*T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Cl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}closed\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT\\Rightarrow U&\\Longrightarrow(\\chi(T)\\leftrightarrow\\chi(U))\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}(T)&\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\chi(T)\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\nT_A^0\\Rightarrow^*T\\land\\mathsf{Cl}(T)&\\Longrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi(b)","display":false},{"tex":"F\\leftrightarrow G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond F\\leftrightarrow\\Diamond G","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\chi(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Diamond\\chi(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1953,"backlinks":[{"id":"c6c452d9588f09ff","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-window]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel]] → [[89-thm-gl-tableau-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["59e94f1adddc4fdd","ffd0dbc00149f28a","0006800fa1c85177"]}